{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026PP4dBET9Us1792679042.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國股市回軟，三大指數早段全線下跌。</p><p></p><p>中東局勢緊張，國際油價急升約百分之3，不利投資氣氛。道指曾跌逾300點，跌至52,500點邊緣。納指低開約390點後，跌幅曾經擴大至逾400點，跌穿26,300點。</p><p></p><p>科技股普遍受壓，Meta早段急挫逾百分之6。戴爾電腦和英特爾跌百分之4至5。</p><p></p><p>晶片股輝達、閃迪和美光科技，曾跌百分之2至3。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:28.771372+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T14:23:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T05:18:01.786427+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:16.788824+00:00","content_hash":"53d60dba521f9a3d3aed998a794a1cb16ce470f5d23c26ddb8dac469f44dd733","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:28.771372+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}